The plain diffusion version will be made available soon.
The advection version doesn't really have a useable implementation at the moment. We discuss some of this, with references, in Sections 2.6 and 4.3 in this newly submitted paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.01084
The advection aspects is in one of the Fuglstad et al papers you can find in the reference list at the end.

Finn

